            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nJudging by [these lines](https://github.com/neoclide/coc.nvim/blob/9c079ad79d66d4ede7886cc4094a822352559502/plugin/coc.vim#L534-L556), all diagnostic related highlights from 'coc.nvim' should work out of the box.\r\n\r\nAs I don't use 'coc.nvim', would you mind testing if completely removing [these lines from 'mini.hues'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/1ad462d0c4a9c83a2202f96504aba149705485d1/lua/mini/hues.lua#L1376-L1390) give acceptable result?",
